<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $63-1/4 (FIM 298.77).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $63-1/4 (FIM 298.77).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-3/8 at $63-1/4 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 298.77 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed up 4.50 markka at 297.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded in New York on Friday. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down two markka at 80.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR fell $0-3/8 to $19-5/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 92.70 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down one markka at 93.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
